    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2017 the Syndicate had gross claims outstanding of GBP 173.051m. During 2017 there was a material prior-year release: gross prior-year provisions reduced by GBP 77.022m (a c.44.5% release of opening gross claims reserves). The report attributes prior-year movements to favourable reserve development (robust prior reserves and positive claims development), while current-year catastrophe activity (notably Harvey/Irma/Maria) affected the 2017 accident year. The prior-year movement is recorded explicitly in the technical provisions note as a gross release of GBP 77.022m.",
